I'm a System Analyst with an Industrial Engineering background. I turn manual business processes in HR, recruitment and customer service into working systems: I map how the process runs today, define the business rules and data structures, and build the tool together with the people who use it.

Since 2023 I have also taken on freelance projects (Odoo ERP, process simulation and automation). I'm open to full-time employment, freelance opportunities, and project collaborations across business, technology, and digital transformation—including custom software, workflow automation, data processing and reporting.
